<title>JAPAN: Kyushu Matsushita - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kyushu Matsushita - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		143.95		vs	  138.39</p>
<p> Operating	prft 166 million    vs   loss 669    million</p>
<p> Current	    824    million    vs	  150    million</p>
<p> Net		  431    million    vs	   77    million</p>
<p> EPS		    2.45 yen	  vs	    0.44 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    176 million	  vs	 176 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p> -Special div	    -		vs	    2.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kyushu Matsushita Electric Co Ltd makes information, video and audio equipment.</p>
